  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LightShadow.UI.QuestionData
  question: A plant grows from a small seed into a large tree. Most of its new mass
    comes from...
  options:
  - The soil
  - The water that was poured on it
  - Carbon dioxide in the air
  - Sunlight
  correctIndex: 2
  category: 0
  difficulty: 3
  explanation: Photosynthesis builds the plant's body from carbon dioxide in the
    air. Experiments tracing carbon show the soil adds very little mass.
